  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce TB and MDR-TB burden in Bhutan - Bhutan (01-Jul-2015-30-Jun-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bhutan, Tuberculosis, Ministry of Health of the Royal Government of Bhutan (MOH)This program has the following goals: To reduce TB and MDR TB burden untill it no longer poses a public health problem in Bhutan. The objectives of this program are: Objective: Improve TB-HIV collaborative activities and increase HIV testing among TB patients to 80%.  Objective: To ensure early diagnosis and treatment of all MDR-TB cases and sustain Treatment Success Rate of 85%.  Objective: To sustain and increase case notification rate of &#x2265; 90% among prevalent cases.  Objective: To sustain and increase treatment success rate of &#x2265; 90%</narrative>
  </description>
